---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import siteData from '../data/site.json';
---

<Layout title={`Privacy Policy - ${siteData.salon.name}`}>
  <div class="pt-32 pb-24 bg-brand-cream min-h-screen">
    <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-6">
      <div class="text-center mb-12 reveal">
        <div class="inline-block text-brand-gold text-xs font-bold tracking-[0.2em] uppercase mb-3">
          Legal
        </div>
        <h1 class="font-display text-4xl md:text-5xl text-brand-charcoal mb-4">
          Privacy <em class="italic font-medium text-brand-gold">Policy</em>
        </h1>
        <p class="text-slate-500 text-sm font-light">
          Last updated: {new Date().toLocaleDateString('en-US', { month: 'long', day: 'numeric', year: 'numeric' })}
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="bg-white border border-slate-200/80 rounded-2xl p-8 md:p-12 shadow-sm reveal space-y-8 text-slate-600 leading-relaxed font-light text-sm md:text-base">
        <div>
          <h2 class="font-display text-xl md:text-2xl font-medium text-brand-charcoal mb-3">1. Information We Collect</h2>
          <p>We collect information you provide directly to us when you book an appointment, contact our salon, or connect with us on social media. This may include your name, phone number, email address, and service preferences.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="pt-8 border-t border-slate-100">
          <h2 class="font-display text-xl md:text-2xl font-medium text-brand-charcoal mb-3">2. How We Use Your Information</h2>
          <p>We use the collected information solely to schedule appointments, send appointment confirmations or reminders, respond to inquiries, and inform you of promotions or updates regarding {siteData.salon.name}.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="pt-8 border-t border-slate-100">
          <h2 class="font-display text-xl md:text-2xl font-medium text-brand-charcoal mb-3">3. Sharing of Information</h2>
          <p>We respect your privacy and never sell, rent, or trade your personal information. We only share details with trusted service providers necessary to operate our booking or messaging systems, or as required by applicable law.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="pt-8 border-t border-slate-100">
          <h2 class="font-display text-xl md:text-2xl font-medium text-brand-charcoal mb-3">4. Contact Us</h2>
          <p>If you have any questions or requests regarding your personal information, please call {siteData.salon.name} directly at <a href={`tel:${siteData.salon.phoneRaw}`} class="text-brand-gold hover:underline font-medium">{siteData.salon.phone}</a> or visit us at {siteData.salon.fullAddress}.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>
